      "source": "<code>DelegatingSmartContextLoader</code> is a concrete implementation of\n<a href=\"../AbstractDelegatingSmartContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>AbstractDelegatingSmartContextLoader</code></a> that delegates to a\n<a href=\"../GenericXmlContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>GenericXmlContextLoader</code></a> (or a <a href=\"../GenericGroovyXmlContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>GenericGroovyXmlContextLoader</code></a> if Groovy\nis present in the classpath) and an <a href=\"../AnnotationConfigContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>AnnotationConfigContextLoader</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>DelegatingSmartContextLoader</code> 是 <a href=\"../AbstractDelegatingSmartContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>AbstractDelegatingSmartContextLoader</code></a> 的一个具体实现，它委托给一个 <a href=\"../GenericXmlContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>GenericXmlContextLoader</code></a>（如果类路径中存在 Groovy，则委托给 <a href=\"../GenericGroovyXmlContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>GenericGroovyXmlContextLoader</code></a>）和一个 <a href=\"../AnnotationConfigContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>AnnotationConfigContextLoader</code></a>。",
